If you have a large fish tank, this can help you increase the humidity whether you have fish or not. You just need to fill it almost full and place it strategically in the room so it's out of the way.
To use the heat from your heater to humidify your home, simply keep a full glass of water near it, or even on top of the unit if you prefer. This process slowly evaporates the water, and the steam is responsible for adding moisture to the environment and preventing it from drying out.
