What aspects should we start from in bag making to ensure the quality of finished products?
What aspects should we start from in bag making to ensure the quality of finished products?
Surface raw materials Non heat sealing raw materials are preferred, and raw materials with good thermal stability and small thermal deformation should be considered, such as BOPA, BOPET, BOPP, paper, etc.
Select appropriate heat seals as required and clean them to ensure good flatness of heat sealing knife surface, and check whether the heat insulation cloth is intact and smooth;
Check the condition of all parts of the bag making machine, preset the pressure sealing temperature according to the working experience, preheat and realize the preset temperature for 20 minutes before it can be put into formal manufacturing. It should also be noted that achieving the preset temperature does not mean that the heat seal has achieved the preset temperature, but requires a period of heat conduction to achieve balance;
For the adjustment of bag making process conditions, temperature, pressure and time (efficiency) are the three indispensable elements of heat sealing and the most critical conditions of process parameters. Temperature, pressure and time (efficiency) need to be adjusted to achieve the best condition.
The heat sealing temperature shall be set according to the material, thickness and processing efficiency of the composite material. In the actual manufacturing process, due to the influence of many factors such as heat sealing pressure, bag making efficiency and the thickness of composite substrate, the heat sealing temperature is usually higher than the melting temperature of superheated sealing raw materials.
Generally, the heat sealing frequency shall be at least twice. The frequency of longitudinal heat sealing lies in the ratio of effective length of longitudinal heat sealing knife to bag length; The transverse heat sealing frequency is determined by the number of groups of transverse heat sealing equipment of bag making machine.
In addition to the visual inspection of specifications and appearance, it is also necessary to inspect the sealing strength and sealing characteristics. If any problem is found, adjust it immediately and make detailed records.
Heat sealing strength;
Specification, flatness, appearance quality of packaging bag, front and rear alignment of packaging bag and other customer requirements, such as tear position, etc; The placement direction of zippers, especially in the zipper connection section;
For the sealing characteristics of packaging bags, a kind of penetrant added with dye can be sprayed into the seal to observe the degree of penetration, or the method of hanging water upside down in the bag for 24 hours to see whether it is water seepage can be used for inspection;
