Let’s have a specific understanding. Spunlaced non-woven fabric, spunlaced process is to spray high-pressure micro water into one or more layers of fiber network, so that the fibers are entangled with each other, so that the fiber mesh can be reinforced and has certain strength.
Wet process non-woven fabric, this kind of non-woven fabric is to open the fiber raw materials in the water medium into single fiber, and mix different fiber raw materials to make fiber suspension slurry. The suspension slurry is transported to the meshing mechanism, and the fiber is netted in the wet state and then reinforced into cloth.
