The load-bearing performance of sewing non-woven bag is much stronger than that of ultrasonic heat-soluble non-woven bag. As the hot-melt non-woven fabric bag is only bonded together by high temperature, all the forces will bear on a hot melting point, so the load-bearing capacity of the hot-melt non-woven fabric bag is not strong.
In the process of movement, most of the force of the non-woven bag will bear on the four points of the hand of the non-woven bag. If the load-bearing performance of the four points is not easy to tear, the load-bearing performance will be greatly enhanced.
As mentioned above, during the movement of ordinary non-woven bags, all the center of gravity will be loaded on the four points of the hand. If we put the mobile car to the bottom of the bag or around the bag, the weight-bearing center area of the non-woven bag will increase many times, and the center of gravity will not be supported by the four points of the hand.
