In recent years we have learned how to do some tutorials and practices homemade by having a long time with confinement. Of course, this does not mean giving up going to the hairdresser, buto yes learn to cut hair with the help of a razor for those moments we need.
It will be much more comfortable to work the hair when it's clean, since the hair full of some type of cream, fixation or even if it is greasy, it will not be practical. Even if you have untangled hair, he will always be much more decisive for his court.
For machine cuts it is preferable that the hair is dry. At the end of the cut you can wet it a little to be able to finish off some stitches much better with the scissors or with the machine itself.
The number 1 comb: It will make a cut almost to the zero or shaved.
The number 3 and 4 comb: makes medium cuts, for those classic cuts.
First step: it is important to have clean hair as outlined above. Must start at the sides and back of the head.
Second step: important delimit the areas well and not start on another area of the head until you are sure you have finished other areas. Finish off the rear area well and the machine begins to pass through the upper part with another level of cut.
Fourth step: We will nuance the two cutting lines with the razor. Between the upper area of the head and the lower area, it will be necessary to leave between both parts a blurred effect.
