Rectangle: The length of the face is long and it is equal in width throughout the face.
Diamond: Face length is longest, with cheekbones next, then forehead, and a smaller jawline with a pointed chin.
Oval: The length of the face is longer than the measurement of the cheekbones and the forehead is larger than the rounded jaw.
Choose the right clothes
Not everyone looks good in a fitted t-shirt and jeans. The most important thing to remember here is that clothing that doesn't fit well with leather distorts your body's proportions.
Whatever your style, choosing the right clothing size is the first step you should take to, in addition to changing your appearance, change the way you dress and your look in general.
