Fashion for 60-year-old men | Stylish Men
There is no downside to dressing elegant and stylish at 60 years old. There is a maturity in all aspects and many men are reaffirmed in continuing with a marked and renewed style.
2 What can not be missing in the wardrobe of a 60-year-old man?
How is fashion defined for 60-year-old men?
Men at this age may find themselves with moments that they have to take care of with an elegant appearance, for example, with a date. It is essential to have good basics in the wardrobe, all of them of good quality.
The basic ones are the most recommended., since they can always be combined with clothes that are in fashion that season. Cotton chino pants are the essential basics, for day to day you can not miss the color black and navy blue.
It's about power offer that iota that you like and go to the last, with a refreshing and fresh style. Choosing basic garments is a classic, but nothing to choose something that looks old-fashioned, they must be consistent with the age, but defining a new image and without masking the age.
The Chinese are the brand par excellence and have countless brands who work with this style. There are many prices, colors and textures to wear, you just have to find one that suits you.
The width of the legs must be straight, a little baggy, but with a narrow waist. Their look has to confront that slimmer look where they'll have that narrow cut and from the knee down a little bit more fitted.
The jeans they are also an attraction for this age, the slim fit cut are perfect again with a medium dark or dark blue color. Jeans with many fades or tears do not look good.
